ing several in the process the  remaining citizens then rushed to board  the train meanwhile igorma and takumi  attempt to board the train with his gun  moon made to take something different  about egoma and vouchers for him so he  can board the train ayame the station  owner's daughter uses the special key to  start the train's engine gurusu ayame's  personal bodyguard tells mumey to defend  the train's rear but she refuses and  falls asleep while fending off a garbane  ikoma's infected heart is exposed he  gets shot by gurusu and falls off the  train however the train is stopped by a  malfunction of the drawbridge and the  passengers witness ikonwa killing the  garbane lecturing the passengers for  their distrust igor manually releases  the drawbridge allowing the train to  leave despite the people's objections  nakumi and mumei get ikoma back on the  train before kurusu can kill him mummy  intervenes and reveals that she and  ikoma are carbonari beings within  existence between humans and gabbani  after mumei reveals her identity as a  carbonari ayame stops gurusu from  killing the carbonari and reminds  everyone that they were rescued by ikoma  and mume the train is headed for the  gong gogango greatest stronghold and  mummy insists on staying on board  however the passengers are filled with  alarm and distrust because of a lack of  food water and whether they'll be  admitted into gongokaku because of the  presence of the carbonaria accompanying  them mummy reveals that she has a  mission and needs help from ikoma  because she gets exhausted after  fighting she begins training igama  personally in preparation for future  garbane attacks the train stops for  water and repairs and the passengers  take the opportunity to pray for those  who died at the station ikoma tells  mummy that he has vowed to avenge his  sister's death at the hands of the  garbane while holding a green stone tied  to his palm which seems to have some  effect on the garbane mummy reveals that  garbaneri can only survive by drinking  human blood as people start panicking a  pregnant woman becomes a garbane and  mummy kills her meanwhile ayami attacks  ikoma but he tells her about his vow to  kill garbane appeasing the passengers  fears of the carbonari however he  becomes insane from his own need of  blood and attacks her  gurusu rescues ayame just as the garbane  appear in the woods surrounding the  train and everyone gets back on board  still fearful of the garbaneri the six  chiefs ask ayami to hand over the  train's master key to her dismay one of  the chiefs reroutes the train for the  mountains to provide a short route to  gongokaku in spite of the increased  danger posed by the garbane on the  exposed mountain path then they forced  dakumi and a girl to go to the train's  last wagon where mumei and ikoma are and  attach the car however the garbane  including wazatori a gabane that's  learned combat techniques and is thus  much more dangerous ambushed the train  and kills some of the passengers ayami  gurusu and the warriors hold off the  garbane while the surviving passengers  escaped to the train's front using his  sword wielding skills gurusu fights the  remaining carbane inside the train at  close quarters simultaneously mume igoma  and their allies escape from their car  and fight the garbane but mermaid falls  asleep from exhaustion gurusu fights the  wazatori but is injured in the process  with ikoma in need of fresh blood ayami  slashes her arm and replenishes him with  her blood after ikoma kills the wazatori  they all celebrate their victory ayami  regains the master key and declares that  she'll allow the carbonari to stay on  board the train offering her blood to  help sustain them igorma's friends and a  number of others including gurusu join  her  igoma helps the warriors develop weapons  to kill the garbani the trade arrives to  another station which was attacked by  garbane who still remain with him the  train passengers rescues some human  survivors who talk of a black fog before  the attack mume meets enoku a crippled  fighter still loyal to her brother the  young master he warns that the shogunate  is acting suspiciously by stockpiling  weapons that aren't for killing garbane  and advises her to complete her mission  since the debris blocked the tracks the  train committee decided to use a crane  to remove it ikomar suggests a cautious  route to the crane but mummy  unexpectedly insists on a head-on clash  with the garbane while ecomart leads a  group of engineers to start the crane  mummy attacks the nest of garbanese  single-handedly estimating that she has  90 seconds of energy left she defeats  them but before the working party can  start the crane even more garbane appear  the crew retreat and ikomas starts to  lift the debris with the crane while  mume uses her remaining energy to fight  the horde of garbane she's then attacked  by a wazatori and ikomar goes to her aid  before he completely removes the debris  at that moment a giant shadowy figure  heads towards the train  the black fog is revealed to be a colony  of garbane fused into one giant beast  unable to leave the train retreats to  the station workshop and they seal the  door the committee discussed their  options of whether to leave or stay  ikomar finds mumei trapped under rubble  and tries to release her unable to free  her he leads the garbani away from her  and kills as many as he can later gurusu  and some others rescue mummy via a  tunnel she runs to find ikoma who is  badly wounded and they all return to the  train together while the black fog beast  is distracted feeding on the bodies of  the dead garbhane ecomart removes the  wreckage from the tracks mummy suggests  a plan to kill the beast using everyone  working together the train leaves the  workshop with the beast in pursuit at  the last possible moment they shoot the  beast with the train's cannon and moonme  kills the woman controlling it who much  to her surp