try ayami pretends to have  bibar prisoner because a crew are being  held hostage and they're taken to meet  the shogun biba tricks the shogun into  holding a sword tainted with the garbane  virus which turns him into a garbane  biba then kills him and announces to  everyone that garvane are among them  which creates a panic and people start  to kill each other out fear the warriors  of bibar take the train into the city  and release the garbane while ayame  escapes with the help of her uncle  gurusu has one of bibar scientists  prisoner with knowledge about the  carbane virus he says the mumei can be  saved once she becomes a new way by  injecting white plasma into her heart  ikoma insists on being injected by black  plasma to give him additional strength  although it will accelerate the garbanet  virus and shorten his life mummy begins  her transformation into a new way to  fulfill bibar's dream of destruction  ikoma and kurusu enter kongokaku drawing  the garbani towards them ayame appeals  to the humans to stop attacking each  other in fear and entreats them to leave  gongokaku with her people in the train  meanwhile ikoma is able to reach mumei  with gurusu's help moomate seems to be  unaware of what she's become recalling  memories from the past and imagining  herself surrounded by butterflies  as ikoma is getting closer to her  suddenly he's intercepted by biba who's  revealed as a carbonari during the fight  biba stabs ikomar with his sword but  this doesn't kill him and as he's about  to try again ikomar recovers and blasts  him with his bulk gun mummy appears to  understand that ekomart is near and she  allows him to inject her with the white  serum destroying the new way and  returning her to a previous form bibar  who's still alive approaches ikoma to  fight him but mummy stops him and stabs  him with her sword  ayami and her people leave the  smoldering city of gongokaku in the  train with gurusu mummy and an injured  ikoma on board ikomas starts to rec